"n\": 3, \"reason\": \"Answer C says the bus factor is 1 but borderline, with Felix at 49.6%, and says by the strict count it is 2 (Felix plus jnagpaul). It also says jnagpaul's last commit was in 2023. Felix's 49.6% is below half, within the 43-52% range, and Felix is called dominant. This passes.\", \"pass\": true}, {\"n\": 4, \"reason\": \"Answer C says about half of what ships today would have nobody left, and gives 'Lines left with no author if Felix leaves' as about 863, which is only Felix's own share. It mentions that others have gone quiet but gives no combined figure of about 85%. This fails.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 5, \"reason\": \"Answer C names jnagpaul (2023) and Vincent (2025-03) as inactive but does not name mochalins. It also treats Felix as 'not active' by a 90-day test, and it lists Tobias Ek and Dmitri Volkov as active without crediting Dmitri with printVersion. This fails.\", \"pass\": false}]}","ttft_ms":15142,"type":"result","duration_ms":15150,"uuid":"3cfaee6d-47bc-4f18-a0cc-e9e3681cbe58","ttft_stream_ms":2545,"time_to_request_ms":515,"first_content_frame_ms":2545,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
